# GENERATED INDEXES — NOT DISTRIBUTED.
# They are built with CodeWalker from the user's OWN GTA V install
# (290 MB) and depend on the game version. The recipient builds them with `/asset-build`.
# They are also Rockstar's data; sharing them would not be right.
data/

# EXCEPTION — HAND-WRITTEN tables. No script builds them; they are not Rockstar's
# bulk data but small lookup tables compiled from community / Sollumz research
# (~20 KB in total). They must ship with the repository: otherwise
# `assetdb.py mat` does not work for a user without GTA V, and that information
# cannot be generated from ANYWHERE.
!data/
data/*
!data/collision_materials.tsv
!data/collision_flag_presets.tsv
!data/light_presets.tsv

# Temporary
*.tmp
*.log
_raw/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Backups / leftovers (*.yedek = Turkish for backup, from older local copies)
*.yedek
*.bak
*.orig
